{"thread":{"threadID":3977,"boardID":117,"topic":"CTF Server Online","time":1481132149,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","lastPostTime":1481141445,"lastPoster":"OxygeN","replies":11,"views":333,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":1},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":54052,"threadID":3977,"userID":1,"username":"BlackFire","subject":"CTF Server Online","time":1481132149,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2,"username":"Sky","time":1481136714,"value":1},{"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","time":1481137562,"value":1},{"userID":2214,"username":"Berkay","time":1481133596,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Hey,</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>soeben ist der Capture The Flag Server online gegangen.<br>Das Spielprinzip sollte bekannt sein, es ist dort hingehend auch kaum verändert worden:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Auf 9 Maps treten max. 16 Spieler in 2 Teams gegeneinander an und versuchen die Flagge des gegnerischen Teams zu erobern und zu ihrer eigenen zu bringen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Installiert sind weiterhin Plugins wie Rank, Stamm &amp; Store.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Die Server-IP lautet: 46.105.160.158:26788</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Wir wünschen viel Spaß beim Spielen und bitten um Fehlermeldungen, falls es zu Unregelmäßigkeiten kommt.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>BlackFire</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54055,"threadID":3977,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1481132269,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Geeeeeeeeilooooo<br>Gleich mal suchten</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54072,"threadID":3977,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1481136851,"lastEditTime":1481138837,"editCount":1,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":1825,"editor":"Nachtfrische","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Update:<br></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Spawnprotection Plugin wurde eingeführt<br><br><ul>\n<li>Nach dem Spawn ist man 3 Sekunden lang unverwundbar</li>\n<li>Die Spawnprotection wird außerdem aufgehoben, wenn man einen Schuss abgibt</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>Spawn Trapping wurde verboten, siehe dazu die Regeln: <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?thread/3978-ctf-07-12-16/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">[CTF] 07.12.16</a>\n</li>\n<li>Man hat nun Kevlar + Helm nach dem Spawn</li>\n<li>Es ist nun nicht mehr möglich, nach dem Tod dem Gegner zu zuschauen</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Danke für das bisherige Feedback, sollten weitere Ideen vorhanden sein, schreibt es bitte in diesen Thread.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54073,"threadID":3977,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1481137311,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann nicht connecten :((</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54074,"threadID":3977,"userID":1125,"username":"Stabiler Jesus","subject":"","time":1481137430,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich auch nicht diese scheise kacke</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54076,"threadID":3977,"userID":1749,"username":"CyberTroniX","subject":"","time":1481138797,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ist absichtlich so. Keine Sorge</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":54077,"threadID":3977,"userID":1825,"username":"Nachtfrische","subject":"","time":1481139152,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Update 2:<br></p>\n<ul><li>Die Zeit, die benötigt wird, um die eigene gedroppte Flagge zurückkehren zu lassen wurde von 10 auf 5 Sekunden reduziert</li></ul>","polls":[]},{"postID":54078,"threadID":3977,"use